# Opposing Force combat knife. Measured by vrcardgen, finished by hand.
#
# Part K: "Melee with the same swept-head method as the crowbar: a short,
# light blade, fast, stabbing or slashing."
#
# So it is the crowbar's mechanism with different numbers. It starts counting
# at a lower speed than the crowbar, because a knife does not need momentum
# to cut, and it reaches its full damage sooner for the same reason. A short
# radius, because a blade is thin.

weapon v_knife
match  bones 24  seqs 13  hash 0x5a8efa8a

# The bone every position in this card is measured in - the controls, the
# grab points, the chamber, the ejection port. Nothing recorded it until
# the engine had to place a control in the world to ask whether a thumb is
# near it; the simulator never needed one, because it never works in world
# space. Taken from the generator, which has always called this bone the
# WEAPON BODY and is what measured these numbers in the first place.
body   "Bip01 R Forearm"

strike point 0.00 0.00 0.00  radius 1.5  from 35  full 180
